:"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8pzVSfj7R3yzOlTepfcIzA","review_id":"_2IkBpdfjEiUe89HCsLlDA","date":"2008-09-28T14:30:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9225348234176636,"text_excerpt":"hmm. It's funny but the thing I like about this place is that it never seems like a tourist place to me. It's the coffee shop I always go to in the FQ because it is like a little oasis from the desert of tourism that the Quarter has become. I've only ever seen locals, usually people who work or live in the FQ in and out for a cup to go or people reading the paper. The coffee is consistently good."},{"business_id":"8pzVSfj7R3yzOlTepfcIzA","review_id":"yWNRmRnTpXx6QlR2j7LPLA","date":"2013-04-06T07:03:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9224089980125427,"text_excerpt":"My favorite coffe shop in the Quarter mainly because I enjoy their courtyard and they have free wifi. The Quarter has so many beautiful and charming courtyards and this one doesn't disappoint. It is a quiet place to read, relax, etc. Inside seating is limited as they only have a few tables. Cheap coffee/drink prices! Can't comment on how their coffee taste as I am not a coffee drinker. An oasis away from the hustle of the Quarter :)"},{"business_id":"8pzVSfj7R3yzOlTepfcIzA","review_id":"RTnNkQag642OEGYnf6ncBg","date":"2012-06-20T23:09:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9181404709815979,"text_excerpt":"Bumping them up a star. Royal *Courtyard* is more like it (though there already is one of those). On even a muggy day like today, sitting out there is a joy. Think it's too hot for ya to sit out there? Trust me, their iced coffee effin' rocks. OK, and if you must, the interior is pretty swell (love the current art they have up on the walls. DO check it out) and has good a/c. Hello, free wifi. Sometimes, you really can pretend you're on vacation when you live here."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
